==Russian==

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|ru|id=loan|:bor|de:Kredit<id:loan>|tree=1}}
First appearance in 1703; original meaning, "authority". Per Vasmer, probably borrowed from {{bor|ru|de|Kredit}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|креди́т}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-кредит.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|креди́т|adj=креди́тный}}

# [[loan]]
# [[credit]] {{q|in the wider sense, not specifically in reference to credits and debits}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative}} [[credit]], [[credibility]]

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|креди́т}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|кредитова́ть|g=impf}}, {{l|ru|кредитова́ться|g=impf}}
** {{l|ru|кредитова́ние|g=n}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ru|кредито́р|g=m-an}}
* {{l|ru|кре́до|g=n}}

